# shared/output-templates.yaml — named structural templates for any
# outward-facing artifact this pipeline produces. Copy this template to
# output-templates.yaml before first use. Never hand-filled — seeded
# entirely through 21-output-templates' conversational elicitation; see
# that skill's own confirm-before-write step (Rule 11 — this file is
# confirmed directly by that skill, not routed through
# 07-context-architect, since these are pipeline-behavior preferences,
# not career-fact memory).
#
# Empty by default. Every producing skill (06-cover-letter,
# 08-application-qa, 05-resume-customizer, 14-social-discovery-outreach,
# 17-cold-prospecting) falls back to its own existing built-in default
# whenever nothing here matches — this file is purely additive, and an
# empty list changes nothing about current behavior.

